---
import { PRODUCT_NAME } from '../../config';

/** The note is signed with initials only. */
const FOUNDER_NAME = 'AK';
---
<section class="s wrap founder" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-h">
  <div class="founder-in">
    <h2 id="why-h">Why I built {PRODUCT_NAME}</h2>
    <p>These days, agents write the code, open the PRs, and sometimes even merge them. It's got to the point where keeping up with what's being shipped is almost impossible, and the easy way out is to stop reading PRs and just trust the agents.</p>
    <p>The Git clients we have were built before agents. They can't tell you what happened while you were on a coffee break. So I built {PRODUCT_NAME}, to stay the one who decides what ships.</p>
    <p><em>I use it every day. If something breaks, tell me on <a href="https://x.com/0xa3k5" rel="noopener">@0xa3k5</a> or <a href="mailto:hey@akml.io">hey@akml.io</a>.</em></p>
    <p class="sig"><em>— {FOUNDER_NAME}</em></p>
  </div>
</section>
